    "effect": "You may use @UUID[Compendium.ptu.journals.JournalEntry.NuifZmyV41EwsMns.JournalEntryPage.dF5LFIsf6EgtVncf]{Arcane Weapons}. Attacks made with your Arcane Weapons share the Type of your @UUID[Compendium.ptu.edges.Item.fURF8NQAVF1jzsBc]{Elemental Connection}. If you have @UUID[Compendium.ptu.edges.Item.qvIqXtN2QM5dIwgX]{Mystic Senses}, these Attacks deal Normal Type Damage. Arcane Weapon users that qualified through Mystic Senses or Elemental Connection (Normal) gain a +5 Bonus to Damage Rolls and a +2 Bonus to Effect Range when using Arcane Weapon Attacks. When wielding an Arcane Weapon, you may resist @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.h0slhD40dRasSRXj]{Disarm Maneuvers} with your Occult Education.",
